    "@value" : "Product parameters as listed in the ESPR Annex I :\n\n(p) microplastic and nano plastic release as expressed through the release during relevant\nproduct life cycle stages, including manufacturing, transport, use and end of life stages;\n\nThis class description needs to be extended/specialised according to the corresponding delegated acts or/and industry standards."
