  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Defines the natural or legal person responsible for the EU declaration of conformity.\n\n\nEUDeclarationOfConformity is modelled in the EU DPP CO COMP module.\nActor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module."
